-- the cluster's close: the two reads' gap `8` inside `528`
example :
    BPair.scale
      (windowsep.mag (readGap
        (dotN colA
          (matVec (inertia.headPad 3 AobsA)
            (matVec cA colA)),
         dotN colA colA)
        (inertia.quadForm (inertia.headPad 3 AobsA) colA
          * inertia.quadForm cA colA,
         dotN colA colA * dotN colA colA)))
      (2 * (1 * ((1 * (certD (List.take 1 capsA)
